th engineering, design, and business teams to deliver scalable AI features.\n* Work with global stakeholders (including China HQ) for roadmap alignment and execution.\n* Drive product innovation tailored to India\u2019s diverse user base.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Required Skills \\& Experience**\n\n\n\n\n**Experience**\n\n\n\n* 6\u20139 years of Product Management experience.\n* Minimum 3\\+ years in AI/ML\\-powered products.\n* Proven experience delivering AI features at scale (10M\\+ users preferred).\n* Hands\\-on exposure to:\n* LLM/API integrations\n* Edge AI / on\\-device inference\n* Strong experience in competitive analysis and product strategy.\n* Experience working with external tech partners (AI startups, telecom, chip vendors).\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**India Market Expertise**\n\n\n\n* Deep understanding of India\u2019s mobile ecosystem:\n* OEM competition\n* Android ecosystem\n* Localization \\& vernacular needs\n* Rural/Tier 2\u20134 market dynamics\n* Experience conducting field research and building user\\-centric products.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Soft Skills**\n\n\n\n* Ability to work in a global, cross\\-cultural environment.\n* Comfortable collaborating across time zones \\- Asian\n* Strong analytical, problem\\-solving, and decision\\-making skills.\n* High ownership mindset with ability to work in ambiguity.\n* Strong bias toward user\\-first thinking and field insights.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Education**\n\n\n\n* Bachelor\u2019s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, or related field (mandatory)\n* MBA from a reputed institute (preferred)\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Why Join Us**\n\n\n\n* Opportunity to build AI products impacting millions of users\n* Work at the forefront of AI innovation in India\n* Collaborate with global teams and leading AI ecosystem partners\n* Fast\\-paced, high\\-impact environment with strong growth potential"},{"title":"Product Manager Internship","company":"Codonyx india","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-08-11","url":"